{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >StarDust is a game about transgalactic exploration, discovery, battle, and conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently only features the single player and multiplayer battle modes, where you find yourself in a three-dimensionally looped &quot;Singularity&quot; in outer space to fight it out for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include lasers, dumbfire and homing missiles, some of which have huge detonations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A future release will include a campaign mode where you explore, discover and take over nearby inhabitable planets.\u00a0The random planet generator that will be used in campaign mode is currently available to create your own planets in the Planet Generator screen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3082510?t=1770335890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770335890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082510/247ca7b4776f6b28dbbaea60c7b998fe96c862e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770335890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082510/247ca7b4776f6b28dbbaea60c7b998fe96c862e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770335890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >StarDust is a game about transgalactic exploration, discovery, battle, and conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently only features the single player and multiplayer battle modes, where you find yourself in a three-dimensionally looped &quot;Singularity&quot; in outer space to fight it out for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include lasers, dumbfire and homing missiles, some of